add("guide/component-map.md",
  doc("如何选择组件", "先按用户任务选分类，再按容器大小和状态选择组件；组件名与 API 保持一致，不需要先了解内部目录。", [
    ["查找路径", "在[全部组件](/components/)输入名称、中文场景或交互词，再用使用场景和平台筛选。侧栏按同一份组件规范分类；选错条件时可重置筛选。"],
    ["通用组件", "| 任务 | 分类 | 示例 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 页面骨架与跳转 | 布局、导航 | Screen、AppLayout、ScreenHeader、SearchBar |\n| 输入与选择 | 表单 | Input、Select、DatePicker、FileUpload（媒体与上传） |\n| 展示信息 | 数据展示 | Avatar、Tag、DescriptionList、DataTable |\n| 表达状态与恢复 | 状态与反馈 | EmptyState、StatusBanner、ProgressBar |\n| 临时任务 | 浮层与弹窗 | Modal、Drawer、BottomSheet、FormSheet |"],
    ["IM 与业务界面", "| 任务 | 分类 | 选择建议 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 浏览或管理会话 | 会话 | 列表、详情、转发与会话操作 |\n| 组成聊天界面 | 消息 | 列表、气泡、状态、已读与置顶 |\n| 渲染一条消息 | 消息内容 | 文本、图片、语音、文件等内容体 |\n| 编辑发送内容 | 输入 | Composer、录音、表情与成员选择 |\n| 发放或查看红包 | 红包 | [发送、卡片、领取和详情](/red-packet/)是一组连续界面 |\n| 钱包与敏感确认 | 账户与认证 | AccountView、PaymentConfirmation、DocumentCapture |\n| 承载可选能力 | 插件界面 | PluginPage、PluginForm、CapabilityConsent |\n| 社交关系与个人内容 | 通讯录、群组、个人中心、圈子 | 按当前任务选详情、设置或内容编辑组件 |"],
    ["组件、组合模式与应用套件", "单个控件优先选通用组件；带 IM 语义的局部任务选 IM 组件；需要会话列表、消息区、输入区协作时选 [Patterns](/patterns/)；完整导航与应用装配选 [App Kit](/app-kit/)。不要为复用一个按钮引入整套应用。"],
    ["接入顺序", "先看组件页预览与状态，再读用法、API 和平台差异。PC 检查键盘、抽屉与内容限宽；手机检查 320px、长文案、触控区和安全区。UI 组件不接管服务、权限、支付或持久化。"],
  ]),
  doc("Choosing components", "Start with the user task, then choose the container and state. Component names remain API names; you do not need to learn the source tree first.", [
    ["Find a component", "Search [all components](/en/components/) by name, task, or interaction, then filter by category and platform. The sidebar uses the same component specification. Reset filters to recover from an empty result."],
    ["General components", "| Task | Category | Examples |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Structure and navigation | Layout, Navigation | Screen, AppLayout, ScreenHeader, SearchBar |\n| Input and selection | Form | Input, Select, DatePicker; FileUpload lives in Media & uploads |\n| Display information | Data Display | Avatar, Tag, DescriptionList, DataTable |\n| Feedback and recovery | Feedback | EmptyState, StatusBanner, ProgressBar |\n| Temporary tasks | Overlays | Modal, Drawer, BottomSheet, FormSheet |"],
    ["IM and business interfaces", "| Task | Category | Guidance |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Browse or manage conversations | Conversation | Lists, details, forwarding, and conversation actions |\n| Compose the chat surface | Message | Lists, bubbles, status, receipts, and pins |\n| Render one message | Message content | Text, image, voice, file, and other content bodies |\n| Edit outgoing content | Composer | Composer, recording, emoji, and member selection |\n| Send or inspect a packet | Red packets | [Compose, card, open, and details](/en/red-packet/) form one journey |\n| Wallet and sensitive confirmation | Accounts & verification | AccountView, PaymentConfirmation, DocumentCapture |\n| Host optional capabilities | Plugin interfaces | PluginPage, PluginForm, CapabilityConsent |\n| Social relationships and personal content | Contacts, Groups, Profile, Moments | Choose details, settings, or content editing for the task |"],
    ["Components, patterns, and App Kit", "Use General UI for a control, IM UI for a domain-specific task, [Patterns](/en/patterns/) for cooperating conversation, timeline, and composer panes, and [App Kit](/en/app-kit/) for complete app assembly. Do not import an entire application to reuse a button."],
    ["Integration order", "Inspect the preview and states, then usage, API, and platform differences. Check keyboard, drawers, and content widths on desktop; check 320px, long copy, touch targets, and safe areas on mobile. Services, permissions, payment, and persistence remain host-owned."],
  ]));

